{"unit_id":"tag:06T2:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是余纤维范畴（category）于群胚（groupoids），在<MATH_0002>上，且满足 (S1)。设<MATH_0003>是万有的（versal）形式对象（formal object），它属于<MATH_0004>且位于<MATH_0005>之上。存在态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>，它位于<MATH_0007>之上，具有以下极小性（minimality）性质：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对于每个<MATH_0008>满足<MATH_0009>，推前（pushforwards）\n<MATHSEG_0001>位于其上<MATHSEG_0002>\n给出极小的（minimal）对象（object）<MATH_0010>，它属于<MATH_0011>，并且\n<STRUCT_0003> 对于任意态射（morphism），在形式对象（formal objects）之间，记为<MATH_0012>，相应态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>是满射的（surjective）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":["S"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"versal","target_term":"万有的"},{"source_term":"formal object","target_term":"形式对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"minimality","target_term":"极小性"},{"source_term":"pushforwards","target_term":"推前"},{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小的"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"formal objects","target_term":"形式对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"versal","target_term":"万有的","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"formal object","target_term":"形式对象","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"minimality","target_term":"极小性","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"pushforwards","target_term":"推前","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小的","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"formal objects","target_term":"形式对象","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"词表未批准"}],"notes":[]}
